{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49501","headline":"虞美人 六 · 顾敻","name":"虞美人 六","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"少年艳质胜琼英，早晚别三清。\n莲冠稳篸钿箆横，飘飘罗袖碧云轻，画难成。\n迟迟少转腰身嫋，翠靥眉心小。\n醮坛风急杏枝香，此时恨不驾鸾皇，访刘郎。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"顾敻","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_49501.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49501","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}